# Store screenshots with Storeshot

- With the Storeshot MCP tools (setup: https://storeshot.art/docs/mcp/): `get_store_requirements`,
  then `upload_screenshot` for each raw screenshot (portrait PNG, JPEG or WebP), then
  `create_screenshot_set` with `dryRun: true`.
- Tell the user what it costs and ask the user before spending live credits: live keys spend 1
  credit per image, test keys are free and return sample images.
- Create the set, call `get_job_status` with `waitSeconds` of 50 or less until `final`, then
  `download_results` with `layout: "fastlane"` into the project root.
- Never ask for, print or commit an API key. On `ACCOUNT_LINK_REQUIRED`, show the link and code
  and call `link_status` after the user approves.
- Without the MCP tools, follow https://storeshot.art/docs/agents-quickstart.md (curl and jq).
